# Product Requirements Document (PRD)

**Product Name:** Pivot C — Agency Placement & Onboarding Hub (Free B2B SaaS)

**Target Audience:** Singapore Employment Agencies (EA Directors & Counter Operations Staff)

**Document Owner:** Product Management

**Status:** Draft / Initial Scope

---

## 1. Problem Statement

Singapore Employment Agencies (EAs) operating in the Foreign Domestic Worker (FDW) sector face heavy operational overhead, paper-based friction, and low profit margins per placement:

* **Manual Paperwork Overload:** Placing a single worker requires filling out, printing, physically signing, and filing 5+ complex document sets (Standard EA Agreements, Salary Deduction Schedules, MOM IPA Letters, Safety Agreements, and House Rules). Counter staff spend **30 to 45 minutes per employer** on repetitive paper signing alone.
* **Compliance & Chasing Bottlenecks:** Post-placement administrative tracking is fragmented across paper folders and manual Excel sheets. Staff waste hours chasing employers and workers for missing documents, 6-Month Medical Exam (6ME) slips, and Work Permit renewal deadlines, creating risk of MOM regulatory fines.
* **Low Margin & Static Revenue Streams:** Placement fees face downward price pressure. Agencies lack turnkey, high-margin ancillary revenue streams at the Point of Sale (POS) beyond static referral commissions from traditional insurers.

